# Local clones of separate repos, vendored under the examples folder (START_HERE says to
# leave their inner .git dirs alone). Each has its own GitHub remote, so they are never
# embedded in this vault: committing them would create phantom submodule entries.
General_Tools/ashita_module_examples/xiui/
General_Tools/ashita_module_examples/bovineFH/
General_Tools/ashita_module_examples/bovineBattle/

# Unpacked / generated artifact material — all of it is reproducible from the vendored zip via its
